# Orchestrator Recovery After Mixed Completion — Index Marker

The actual Jest test lives at:

    tests/integration/orchestrator-recovery-after-mixed-completion.integration.test.ts

This sibling-named file (no extension) exists because Raptor's runner validator
(`runner.ts:resolveExpectedOutputPaths`) does literal `*` substitution on the
`tests/integration/*` glob pattern, which produces the path
`tests/integration/{slug}` rather than matching real files via globbing.

The deferred-items list in `docs/sprints/sprint-8-summary.md` calls this out as
`expected-outputs-glob-resolution` and `artifact-injection-directory-handling`.
A directory at this path would trigger EISDIR when `buildStepContext` reads it
during PO Review (step 4); a regular text file like this one is safe.

When that bug is fixed, this marker file can be deleted.

